# Copy to .github/CODEOWNERS and replace EVERY example team with a real authorized team/user.
# Merely committing this example does not enable required reviews.
* @your-org/project-maintainers
/config/ @your-org/quality-maintainers
/tools/ @your-org/quality-maintainers
/.github/ @your-org/quality-maintainers
/.mvn/ @your-org/quality-maintainers
**/pom.xml @your-org/quality-maintainers
/AGENTS.md @your-org/quality-maintainers
**/src/test/ @your-org/quality-maintainers
/experiments/ @your-org/quality-maintainers
/docs/adr/ @your-org/quality-maintainers
/docs/issues/ @your-org/quality-maintainers
